  "details": "I'm unsure how reproducible it is, but I've encountered in three separate searches.\n\nFor my group, I was trying to search up a member by username, but they didn't appear in the group members' search result, and they also didn't appear when I tried searching them on the website through a general user search. I've also encountered this issue, when trying to search for another group.\n\nUser Display Name:  Pickle, Search term: Pickle\n\nGroup Name: Avalikin, Search term: Avali\n\nAvalikin's short code and discriminator is AVALI.5108\n\nWhen changing the search term in the group search to Avalik or Avalikin's short code and discriminator, they do appear in the results.",
